  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 7300 had initially been adopted and filed as an emergency rule pursuant to RSA 541-A:18, I by Document #12982, effective 1-23-20, and titled “Exceptional Disaster Re",
  "recordType": "rule-chapter",
  "ruleText": "Chapter Saf-C 7300 had initially been adopted and filed as an emergency rule pursuant to RSA 541-A:18, I by Document #12982, effective 1-23-20, and titled “Exceptional Disaster Relief Loans.” But the emergency rule was subsequently repealed by the filing of a Statement of Repeal pursuant to RSA 541-A:18, VI in Document #12992, effective 2-20-20.\n\nDocument #13168, effective 2-9-21, adopted Chapter Saf-C 7300 again with some changes from the prior emergency rule including changing the chapter heading to “Homeland Security Emergency Management (HSEM) Exceptional Disaster Relief Loans.”",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c7300.html"
